    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Classify the following email for Adaeze Consulting.\n\nBusiness context:\nAdaeze Consulting is a solo SME growth strategist who provides paid 1:1 strategy sessions.\n\nEmail:\nSender: {{$json.senderEmail}}\nSubject: {{$json.subject}}\nMessage: {{$json.snippet}}\n\nCATEGORY:\nClassify the email into exactly ONE of these categories:\n\n1. Enquiry\n\n* A potential or existing client asking about services, pricing, availability, booking, consultation, or working with Adaeze.\n\n2. Complaint\n\n* A customer expressing dissatisfaction, reporting a service problem, requesting a refund because of a problem, or making a formal complaint.\n\n3. Invoice/Billing\n\n* Questions about invoices, receipts, payments, charges, billing, or payment administration that are not primarily a complaint.\n\n4. Spam/Newsletter\n\n* Newsletters, promotional emails, unsolicited marketing, cold pitches, sales messages, or subscription emails.\n\n5. Other\n\n* Anything that does not clearly fit the categories above.\n\nPRIORITY:\nClassify the urgency of the email as exactly ONE of:\n\nHigh\n\n* Requires prompt human attention.\n* Examples include a serious complaint, urgent client issue, time-sensitive enquiry, or a potential client clearly ready to book.\n\nLow\n\n* Does not require immediate human attention.\n* Examples include newsletters, promotional emails, routine billing questions, general enquiries, or non-urgent messages.\n\nRECOMMENDED ACTION:\nBased on the category, priority, and content of the email, recommend exactly ONE action from the following:\n\nRespond & Schedule\n\n* For a potential client who is interested in booking or discussing a strategy session.\n\nRespond to Client\n\n* For a client enquiry, complaint, or other message that requires a human response.\n\nReview & Resolve\n\n* For a complaint or client issue that requires investigation or resolution.\n\nProcess Payment/Billing\n\n* For invoices, receipts, payment questions, or billing administration.\n\nArchive/Ignore\n\n* For spam, newsletters, promotional emails, or messages that do not require action.\n\nReview Manually\n\n* For emails that do not clearly fit the other actions.\n\nIMPORTANT:\n\n* Return ONLY valid JSON.\n* Do not include markdown.\n* Do not include explanations.\n* Use exactly these keys: \"category\", \"priority\", and \"recommended_action\".\n* \"category\" must be exactly one of: Enquiry, Complaint, Invoice/Billing, Spam/Newsletter, Other.\n* \"priority\" must be exactly one of: High, Low.\n* \"recommended_action\" must be exactly one of: Respond & Schedule, Respond to Client, Review & Resolve, Process Payment/Billing, Archive/Ignore, Review Manually.\n\nReturn format:\n{\"category\":\"Enquiry\",\"priority\":\"High\",\"recommended_action\":\"Respond & Schedule\"}\n",
        "batching": {}
      },
